ath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-28T05:06:08-08:00","id":1557059,"title":"","content":"So from a cursory glance, the Light is a force of positivity and hope, I imagine mages would also correlate it to truth. Perhaps you could make Attainments that reveal the truth, as well as empower Sleepers and Sleepwalkers. Here is a rough outline of possible Attainments.<br /> <br /> <b>Mind 1</b><br /> <i>Perfect Recall </i>with Reach assigned to instant use.<br /> <br /> <b>Reasoning: </b>No good memory shall be lost in the fog of forgetfulness.<br /> <br /> <b>Prime 1</b><br /> An Unveiling of Prime that grants Peripheral Mage Sight to a subject, with conjunctional Mind allowing the to relate the feel of any supernatural phenomena to any similar ones the subject has experienced. Reach is assigned to advanced duration.<br /> <br /> <b>Reasoning: </b>Deny the occult truth of the world no longer.<br /> <br /> <b>Mind 2</b><br /> <i>Mental Shield </i>with Reach assigned to advanced duration.<br /> <br /> <b>Reasoning: </b>Your mind is your own, let none take your freedom.<br /> <br /> <b>Prime 2</b><br /> <i>Supernal Vision </i>with Reach assigned to instant use and advanced duration, with conjunctional Mind 1 allowing it to reveal the nature of other supernaturals.<br /> <br /> <b>Reasoning: </b>Shed light on the occult powers hiding in plain sight.<br /> <br /> <b>Mind 3</b><br /> <i>Sleep of the Just</i> with Reach assigned to advanced duration.<br /> <br /> <b>Reasoning: </b>Let your dreams be peaceful, may you be able to persevere whenever fighting for a good cause.<br /> <br /> <b>Prime 3</b><br /> <i>Pierce Deception </i>with Reach assigned to instant use, advanced duration and giving a symbolic representation of the truth.<br /> <br /> <b>Reasoning: </b>All lies will be brought into the light.<br /> <br /> <b>Mind 4</b><br /> <i>Clear Thoughts</i> with Reach assigned to Lasting effects.<br /> <br /> <b>Reasoning: </b> Let all the ills that would cloud one's thoughts be healed and clarity restored.<br /> <br /> <b>Prime 4</b><br /> <i>Stealing Fire</i> with Reach assigned to indefinite duration and a point of mana paying for indefinite duration.<br /> <br /> <b>Reasoning: </b>The supernatural will not longer be able to hide in the shadows of people's mind.<br /> <br /> <b>Mind 5</b><br /> <i>Telepathy</i> with Reach assigned to instant use, advanced duration, sending only thoughts you wish and anyone being able to send and receive messages.<br /> <br /> <b>Reasoning: </b>Your community is always there to support you.<br /> <br /> <b>Prime 5</b><br /> <i>Words of Truth</i> with Reach assigned to instant use, advanced duration, sensory range and compelling action.<br /> <br /> <b>Reasoning: </b>The light speaks and the heart listens.","signature":